{"ID":"20240513083217-j7rqwi5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083217-j7rqwi5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083217-j7rqwi5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513140739-gmbm2mk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513140739-gmbm2mk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513140739-gmbm2mk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:385,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:507\u0026#125;","title":"158","type":"doc","updated":"20240515122802"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513140739-gmbm2mk","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1008px;","id":"20240513140739-gmbm2mk","updated":"20240515122802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄    初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"120-3 T, R"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"70歲，高瘦腹大"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/04/18"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(請參考02/08/06診療日誌或09/20/06你只能活兩次)目前有裝排水器在右下腹，可自行排腹水"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 早上多白痰，鼻水倒流且黏稠"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 體力很差，睡多"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 大便一日一或二次，色黃且稀"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 小便淡黃，但無力，量少"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 睡，時醒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 手及腿很緊，無法握物，手抖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→多喝熬煮過的蔗糖水(味厚入血分)，急，食甘以緩之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 指甲蒼白"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 仍覺身冷，室內須開暖氣"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 無汗出"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. 胃口一直很好，半夜醒時也餓"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11. 仍有腹積水"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小，無力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃乾紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區鬆動、破洞多、有黃點，胰區乾，腎區反應差"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、面色："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"氣色好多了"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區仍有損傷，甘淡滲利得放"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 同3/31方 胃苓湯  400粉   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 多喝煮過的蔗糖水"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"服3/14方第一帖後，病人來電告知: 人覺不適，解黑便，噁心嘔吐，發抖，忽冷忽熱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"師曰: 此人病已重，不受藥，藥與病相爭，病人受不了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"雖病人有四逆證，因不受藥，轉攻為守；治肝先實脾(甘淡滲利)，故停服3/14方，改胃苓湯粉劑，早晚飯前服三茶匙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}